    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index jumped by 1,190 points week-on-week to 9,177, the steepest such increase since May. There was a $1.70/t rise in the W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate to $15.10/t, while the round -voyage rate surged $15,850/day to $45,500/day.",
